<title>USA: Netframe cuts 13 pct of workforce.</title>
<headline>Netframe cuts 13 pct of workforce.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Netframe Systems Inc said on Friday that it cut 13 percent of its workforce, or 45 employees and contractors, in an effort to reduce operating expenses.</p>
<p>&quot;These reductions are expected to have no impact on new product development or customer service commitments to our customers,&quot; said Bob Puette, chief executive officer.</p>
</text>
